(7702122, 1264381, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but cannot discern any vehicle.  Que lastima.</td>', 'I like the picture but cannot discern any vehicle.  Que lastima.', '2021-09-28 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702123, 1264411, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very cool and very hot.</td>', 'Very cool and very hot.', '2021-09-28 16:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702133, 1264314, 173844, '<td valign="top">Of course the car is great, and the people in it are great.  Old timey.  What I really love is how it''s a reversal of time, the old emerging from the modern, hearkening back to an origin story.  The faded black and white all about the old car artfully conveys the effect.  Something''s gonna happen ...<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Of course the car is great, and the people in it are great.  Old timey.  What I really love is how it''s a reversal of time, the old emerging from the modern, hearkening back to an origin story.  The faded black and white all about the old car artfully conveys the effect.  Something''s gonna happen ...Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-09-28 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7702134, 1264401, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Nicely fills the frame.  The body of the car is reminiscent of a human body, soft and rounded.  Of course car manufacturers have long aimed at making their vehicles sensual.  The overgrowth, fortunately, neatly frames the car.  The opaque reflection on the windshield coyly withholds its secrets.  The grill is magnificent.  The glowing amber of the broken headlamp draws one in.  I very much like the heady saturation, not something I often embrace.  Highly satisfying.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Nicely fills the frame.  The body of the car is reminiscent of a human body, soft and rounded.  Of course car manufacturers have long aimed at making their vehicles sensual.  The overgrowth, fortunately, neatly frames the car.  The opaque reflection on the windshield coyly withholds its secrets.  The grill is magnificent.  The glowing amber of the broken headlamp draws one in.  I very much like the heady saturation, not something I often embrace.  Highly satisfying.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-09-29 00:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
